@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DIDF094_RID02C0_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DIDF094_RID02C0_Handler"
	//ri135 //: WdgM_LocalMode
	//ri136 //: SOH_ERRH_ClearRID0x02C0
	//ri137 //: GlobalTime
	//ri138 //: DataServices_xxx
	//pi142 //: WriteDIDCountertoNvM
	//pi144 //: WdgM_AliveSupervision
    //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus 

   
endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for handling the DID F094 and for the ERRH part of RID 0x2C0. 
Hence, it monitors the local supervision failures and status of SUM SOH allowing also the clearing of all the metrics when required by the SOH. 
It is also responsible for periodically communicating to the WdgM that a checkpoint has been reached
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DIDF094_RID02C0_Handler] as EC{
	portin ri135
	portin ri136
	portin ri137
	portin ri138
	portout pi142
	portout pi144

	[Sum_Ssfm_DIDF094_RID02C0_Handler]  as E
}
   interface II152


  II152 -> E
  ri135 -> E
  ri136 -> E
  ri137 -> E
  ri138 -> E
  E -> pi142
  E -> pi144


@enduml
